  <li><strong>[6]  </strong>Pacific Pests, Pathogens, Weeds &amp; Pesticides. Rice bacterial leaf blight (418). https://apps.lucidcentral.org/pppw_v12/text/web_full/entities/rice_bacterial_leaf_blight_418.htm</li>
